<title>CANADA: Patheon plans C$15 mln common share offer.</title>
<headline>Patheon plans C$15 mln common share offer.</headline>
<dateline>TORONTO 1996-09-16</dateline>
<text>
<p>Pharmaceutical products maker Patheon Inc said on Monday it plans to raise C$15 million in a common share offering in Canada.</p>
<p>It also said it agreed to acquire a Mississauga, Ontario manufacturing facility from Hoffmann-La Roche Ltd for C$13.5 million. Patheon will also manufacture some of Hoffmann-LaRoche's products for Canada and the United States under a two-year agreement.</p>
<p>-- Reuters Toronto Bureau (416) 941-8100</p>
</text>
